{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261119/photo/bkn-20261119163749213-1119_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261119165840\"/><p>事發的聖公會基孝中學。(陳嘉順攝)</p><p>今午(19日)3時42分，藍田啟田道5號聖公會基孝中學，有俗稱「尿袋」的外置充電器起火。消防接報趕至把火救熄，一名14歲男生燒傷，救護員為其初步護理後，再送往聯合醫院治療。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T09:35:02.679862+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T08:37:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T10:08:58.025015+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T09:28:25.155003+00:00","content_hash":"ccccf58ef192d0f42914fce552e83218615e5f8bdbdef95dbc7d642fde6faf39","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}